{"id": 1279, "name": "Medium Starter", "slug": "monge-medium-starter", "category_ids": [3], "brand_id": 5, "attribute_family_id": 1, "attribute_family_name": "Dry Food", "is_best_seller": false, "is_on_sale": false, "is_discontinued": false, "show_unit_price": true, "delete_locked": true, "used_attribute_ids": [3, 4, 5, 7, 9, 17], "min_entry_price": 3400, "variants": [{"id": 1982, "name": "Chicken 15 kg", "about_this_item": "<p>Monge Natural Superpremium Medium Starter for mother and baby dogs, Rich in Chicken (Best for Breeders 15 kg bag): a complete pet food for medium-size puppies and adult pregnant and lactating bitches (10-32 kg). The first ingredient is chicken, and fresh meat makes the formula digestible and palatable. Next-generation XOS (xylo-oligosaccharide) prebiotics support intestinal wellness; glucosamine and chondroitin sulphate support joint development, and a balanced calcium/phosphorus ratio supports regular growth of the puppy's bones and joints. No added dyes or artificial preservatives. Made in Italy.</p>", "ingredient_information": "<p>Composition: chicken (dried 30%, fresh meat 10%), rice, animal fat (chicken oil purified at 99.5%), dried beet pulp, hydrolysed animal proteins (liver), maize, brewers' yeast inactivated, oats, dried eggs, fish (dried salmon), fish oil (salmon oil), minerals, yeast products (MOS 1%), XOS 0.3%, yucca schidigera 0.3%, spirulina 0.3%, glucosamine 0.057%, chondroitin sulphate 0.04%. Analytical components: crude protein 31%, crude fibre 1.5%, crude fat 22%, crude ash 7%, calcium 1.5%, phosphorus 1.1%, n-3 fatty acids 0.5%, n-6 fatty acids 5.5%. Metabolisable energy 4,500 kcal/kg.</p>", "feeding_instructions": "<p>Recommended daily feeding intakes (see the table on the pack) may be split into 3 or more daily meals. Individual requirements vary with size, age and activity. Always have clean, fresh water available. Introduce gradually over at least one week when replacing another food.</p>", "sku": "MG006197", "is_defaul